om/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":3303,"digest":"sha256:ba4c51f0e6d9388b218d3d0c146b165f579d6745f47f0c8ca69c57752a0302d2","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T21:46:31Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T21:46:31Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/releases/download/v0.1.2-linux-stable/LINUX-RELEASE-AUTHORIZATION.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lotulune/Copperbench/tarball/v0.1.2-linux-stable","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Lotulune/Copperbench/zipball/v0.1.2-linux-stable","body":"Copperbench 0.1.2 fixes modeling-task continuity during asset import and refresh, corrects clipboard success/failure feedback, aligns current documentation and centralizes internal asset/reference/health projections. MCP/SDK contracts and workspace storage are unchanged.\n\nThese are the exact tested binaries from candidate source `9bc6d104688c24512468880abdc2a96828fcaab8` and [candidate run 36321809542](https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/actions/runs/36321809542), promoted without rebuilding or relabeling the old 0.1.1 payload. All six original assets passed source-bound GitHub provenance verification.\n\n- Debian SHA-256: `fd43bd23926a2f37042f14d6a65a7d606b59b08035a92d490ff5ded156931aef`.\n- Portable SHA-256: `14576bfafd24cf773b689fecb448aa7dd2f78cf05fd80e79c25eefe874e408fa`.\n- Scope: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS x86_64, GNOME Wayland/Xorg. Installed runtime acceptance covers Fabric and NeoForge 1.21.1; other distributions, architectures and additional Linux tracks are not certified by this run.\n\nAll ten installed gates and both legacy-preferences migration cases passed, including real build/render, external Agent conflict/retry and normal closes, Blockbench edit/save/close, Asset Center launch, UI save/reopen and portable build. The [immutable installed report](https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/blob/v0.1.2-linux-stable/docs/testing/maintenance-012-linux-installed-2026-09-28.md) records successful receipts, retained failed attempts and explicit limits. `LINUX-RELEASE-AUTHORIZATION.json` binds the accepted report and results to these hashes. Original candidate metadata retains its development classification; the separate release authorization governs promotion.\n\nVerify the candidate checksums and GitHub provenance before installation. GNOME may require normal login-keyring authentication before Chromium initializes. Builds used warmed dependency caches; cold-cache/default-network and offline certification are not claimed. Blockbench is external. No new gameplay or efficiency claim is made.\n\nWindows packages are available separately at [v0.1.2](https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/releases/tag/v0.1.2). See the [current publication report](https://github.com/Lotulune/Copperbench/blob/main/docs/testing/maintenance-release-0.1.2.md) for final workflow receipts.\n"}